{"parse":{"title":"角色印象卡：列奥尼德","pageid":3085,"revid":6624,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>角色印象卡：列奥尼德</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E5.8D.B0.E8.B1.A1.E5.8D.A1.7C.E5.88.97.E5.A5.A5.E5.B0.BC.E5.BE.B7\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色印象卡|列奥尼德\">角色印象卡|列奥尼德</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%97%E5%A5%A5%E5%B0%BC%E5%BE%B7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：角色印象卡|列奥尼德\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：开预约的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-08-25 15:12<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FGBOpLCWNpho3rddItgeWWg\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GBOpLCWNpho3rddItgeWWg</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF139.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">人物介绍</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>作为高阶光辉卫士和伊利亚教区的光辉卫士长，列奥尼德拥有骑士的一贯<font color=\"brown\"><b>优良品质</b></font>，忠诚、强大、谦逊、沉默、克制、虔诚... <br />\n多年以来，他<font color=\"brown\"><b>守护</b></font>着法皇之手。被赋予着绝对信任的同时，列奥尼德始终没有忘记<font color=\"brown\"><b>骑士的准则</b></font>。<br />\n他从不因信任而做出任何逾越之举，始终<font color=\"brown\"><b>恪守本分</b></font>，忠实于法皇之手，<font color=\"brown\"><b>忠实</b></font>于自己那颗骑士之心。<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息177.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/44/0pclhtj7se0q5b6p29zydlmqo6kp7zb.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /><br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163727\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 105/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2095/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.440      1 -total\n 53.79%   16.375      1 模板:面包屑\n 45.90%   13.973      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3085-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163727 and revision id 6624. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"科普","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息139.png","官方消息177.jpg"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"角色印象卡|列奥尼德","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"角色印象卡：列奥尼德","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"角色印象卡|列奥尼德"}],"displaytitle":"角色印象卡：列奥尼德","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|科普}}\n=角色印象卡|列奥尼德=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=科普\n|时间=2023-08-25 15:12\n|作者=开预约的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GBOpLCWNpho3rddItgeWWg\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息139.png|560px|link=]]\n<br><br>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">人物介绍</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n作为高阶光辉卫士和伊利亚教区的光辉卫士长，列奥尼德拥有骑士的一贯<font color=brown>'''优良品质'''</font>，忠诚、强大、谦逊、沉默、克制、虔诚... <br>\n多年以来，他<font color=brown>'''守护'''</font>着法皇之手。被赋予着绝对信任的同时，列奥尼德始终没有忘记<font color=brown>'''骑士的准则'''</font>。<br>\n他从不因信任而做出任何逾越之举，始终<font color=brown>'''恪守本分'''</font>，忠实于法皇之手，<font color=brown>'''忠实'''</font>于自己那颗骑士之心。<br><br>\n[[File:官方消息177.jpg|link=]]<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:28.352855+00:00"}